<title>USA: U S West Media Group sets stock repurchase.</title>
<headline>U S West Media Group sets stock repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U S West Media Group said Friday it plans to repurchase up to $350 million of its common stock.  </p>
<p>The company has about 620 million shares outstanding, including 150.6 million common shares issued in its merger with Continental Cablevision, said company spokesman Steve Lang.</p>
<p>U S West Media shares were up 3/4 Friday at 18-7/8.</p>
